SfVLZTPUSlASJqxZmg42o5_HlK1QKuWwtbI5TGN_daIA&oe=6B0B2E27"}, "display_name": "Hero Bootcamp", "keywords": ["Eye", "Tracking", "Hero", "Superhero", "Bootcamp"], "long_description": "Congratulations, recruit \u2014 you\u2019ve been accepted into Hero Bootcamp, the galaxy\u2019s least predictable (and most eye-powered) superhero training program. Your goal? Survive the SHAT \u2014 the Super Hero Acumen Test \u2014 a whirlwind of ridiculous missions that somehow determine whether you're \u201chero material.\u201d\n\n{1173697554514916}\nChannel your inner champion as you fire Laser Eyes at malfunctioning equipment, telekinetically juggle dangerous objects, freeze time to avoid total catastrophe, and use X-Ray Vision to uncover whatever nonsense lurks behind the next wall. Every mission can be solved in multiple ways\u2026 including some we technically didn\u2019t intend.\n\n{1048934014043645}\n\nDesigned as a fun, over-the-top showcase of eye-tracking on Meta Quest Pro*, Hero Bootcamp turns your gaze into your greatest weapon. Don\u2019t have eye-tracking? Don\u2019t sweat it \u2014 recruits on all Meta Quest headsets can still take the SHAT in full.\n\n{1280058330507472}\n\nPut your eyes to work. Save the day. Try not to blow anything up. And remember: heroes aren\u2019t born \u2014 they\u2019re trained\u2026 questionably.\n>\n*Eye-tracking supported only on Meta Quest Pro.", "short_description": "Train for greatness (or chaos) in Hero Bootcamp, the eye-powered superhero training program! Use Laser Eyes, Telekinesis, X-Ray Vision and Time Freeze to survive the SHAT \u2014 the Super Hero Acumen Test. Built to showcase epic eye-tracking mayhem on Meta Quest Pro, and fully playable on all Quest headsets. Eye-tracking optional, accidents inevitable."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://petricoregames.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://petricoregames.com/tos/", "publisher_name": "Petricore", "support_website_url":